sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant VLLM_HTTP as vllm-spyre (HTTP)<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant VLLM_GRPC as vllm-spyre (gRPC)<br/>8033/TCP gRPC
    participant PVC as Model Storage<br/>(PVC Mount)
    participant HFHub as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over PVC,HFHub: Flow 3: Model Loading (Startup)
    VLLM_HTTP->>PVC: Load model weights<br/>filesystem mount
    PVC-->>VLLM_HTTP: Model artifacts
    alt Model not pre-staged
        VLLM_HTTP->>HFHub: GET model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN
        HFHub-->>VLLM_HTTP: Model weights
    end

    Note over Client,VLLM_HTTP: Flow 1: HTTP Inference Request
    Client->>KRBAC: POST /v1/completions<br/>HTTPS/8443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (platform RBAC)
    KRBAC->>KRBAC: Validate authorization<br/>(platform RBAC policy)
    KRBAC->>VLLM_HTTP: POST /v1/completions<br/>HTTP/8000 (localhost)<br/>Auth: None (pre-authorized)
    VLLM_HTTP-->>KRBAC: JSON Response<br/>(completion result)
    KRBAC-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,VLLM_GRPC: Flow 2: gRPC/TGIS Inference Request
    Client->>KRBAC: gRPC Generate request<br/>HTTPS/8443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (platform RBAC)
    KRBAC->>KRBAC: Validate authorization
    KRBAC->>VLLM_GRPC: gRPC Generate<br/>gRPC/8033 (localhost)<br/>Auth: None (pre-authorized)
    VLLM_GRPC-->>KRBAC: gRPC Response<br/>(generated text)
    KRBAC-->>Client: gRPC Response
